  "content": {
    "source": "F02_streaming_brand_tracker_SYNTHETIC.docx",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 0,
        "text": "StreamScope Wave 7",
        "style": "Title",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 1,
        "text": "Streaming Video Brand and Advertising Tracker - Questionnaire (script format) v3.0",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 2,
        "text": "Project ESC-SYN-2602  |  9 September 2026  |  All brands, advertising and figures are fictional",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 3,
        "text": "Wave 7 overview",
        "style": "Heading 1",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": 1
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 4,
        "text": "Purpose: Track awareness, usage, consideration and advertising recall for six streaming services, wave on wave.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 5,
        "text": "Method: Online self-completion. Continuous monthly tracker.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 6,
        "text": "Sample: 600 adults aged 18 and over who watch video content at least weekly, nationally representative on age (18-34: 35%), region and gender.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 7,
        "text": "Interview length: 15 minutes.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 8,
        "text": "Changes from Wave 6",
        "style": "Heading 1",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": 1
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 9,
        "text": "A2 to A4 added for the new Corvo campaign.",
        "style": "List Bullet",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 10,
        "text": "B9 (price perception) removed.",
        "style": "List Bullet",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 11,
        "text": "The brand loop is now capped at three brands (previously every brand used).",
        "style": "List Bullet",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 12,
        "text": "Scripting conventions",
        "style": "Heading 1",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": 1
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 13,
        "text": "Question type tags: [SC] single code, [MC] multi code, [NUM] numeric, [OE] open end, [GRID] grid, [INFO] information screen with no answer.",
        "style": "List Bullet",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 14,
        "text": "Each question is preceded by its base (ASK ALL or ASK IF ...). Where no base is given, the question has the same base as the question before it.",
        "style": "List Bullet",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 15,
        "text": "BRAND LIST means the master list below. Randomise its order once per respondent and keep that order for every question that shows it.",
        "style": "List Bullet",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 16,
        "text": "98 = Don't know and 99 = None of these are exclusive and never randomised.",
        "style": "List Bullet",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 17,
        "text": "CLOSE means end the interview at the named closing code (see Closing and redirects).",
        "style": "List Bullet",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 18,
        "text": "Master brand list:",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 19,
        "text": "1 Vistra+",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 20,
        "text": "2 Nimbus TV",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 21,
        "text": "3 Corvo",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 22,
        "text": "4 Lumen Play",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 23,
        "text": "5 Stagebox",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 24,
        "text": "6 Kestrel Go",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 25,
        "text": "Part A - Screening",
        "style": "Heading 1",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": 1
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 26,
        "text": "ASK ALL",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 27,
        "text": "S1. [NUM] How old are you?",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 28,
        "text": "RANGE 16-99. IF S1 < 18, CLOSE - SO1.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 29,
        "text": "ASK ALL",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 30,
        "text": "S2. [MC] Do you, or does anyone in your household, work in any of these areas?",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 31,
        "text": "1 Television or film production",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 32,
        "text": "2 Streaming or broadcasting",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 33,
        "text": "3 Advertising or marketing",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 34,
        "text": "4 Market research",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 35,
        "text": "99 None of these",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 36,
        "text": "IF ANY OF CODES 1-4, CLOSE - SO2.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 37,
        "text": "S3. [SC] How often do you watch films, series or shows on any screen?",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 38,
        "text": "1 Every day",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 39,
        "text": "2 Several times a week",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 40,
        "text": "3 About once a week",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 41,
        "text": "4 Less than once a week",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 42,
        "text": "5 Never",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 43,
        "text": "IF S3 = 4 OR 5, CLOSE - SO3.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 44,
        "text": "ASK ALL",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 45,
        "text": "S4. [SC] Which region do you live in?",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 46,
        "text": "1 North",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 47,
        "text": "2 Midlands",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 48,
        "text": "3 South",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 49,
        "text": "4 Scotland",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 50,
        "text": "5 Wales",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 51,
        "text": "6 Northern Ireland",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 52,
        "text": "QUOTA - SEE PART E.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 53,
        "text": "Part B - Brand funnel",
        "style": "Heading 1",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": 1
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 54,
        "text": "ASK ALL",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 55,
        "text": "B1. [OE] When you think of streaming services for films and series, which ones come to mind? Please type each one in a separate box.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 56,
        "text": "PROVIDE 6 BOXES; AT LEAST ONE REQUIRED. STORE THE FIRST BOX AS B1_FIRST.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 57,
        "text": "VERBATIMS ARE CODED AFTER FIELDWORK - DO NOT CODE IN THE SCRIPT.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 58,
        "text": "ASK ALL",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 59,
        "text": "B2. [MC] Which of these streaming services have you heard of, even if only by name?",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 60,
        "text": "SHOW BRAND LIST (CODES 1-6) + 99 None of these.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 61,
        "text": "IF B2 = 99, CLOSE - SO4.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 62,
        "text": "ASK IF ANY OF CODES 1-6 AT B2",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 63,
        "text": "B3. [MC] And which of these do you currently use, either with your own account or someone else's?",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 64,
        "text": "SHOW ONLY BRANDS SELECTED AT B2 + 99 None of these.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 65,
        "text": "B4. [GRID] How likely would you be to consider each of these the next time you choose a streaming service?",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 66,
        "text": "ROWS: BRANDS SELECTED AT B2 BUT NOT AT B3.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 67,
        "text": "COLUMNS: 1 Would definitely consider / 2 Might consider / 3 Would not consider.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 68,
        "text": "IF THERE ARE NO ROWS, SKIP B4.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 69,
        "text": "Brand loop (B5 to B7)",
        "style": "Heading 2",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": 2
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 70,
        "text": "LOOP FOR EACH BRAND SELECTED AT B3 (CODES 1-6). IF MORE THAN 3 BRANDS WERE SELECTED, LOOP ON THE 3 WITH THE LOWEST NUMBER OF COMPLETED LOOPS SO FAR. RANDOMISE THE LOOP ORDER. [BRAND] = THE CURRENT LOOP BRAND.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 71,
        "text": "ASK IF ANY OF CODES 1-6 AT B3",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 72,
        "text": "B5. [SC] Overall, how satisfied are you with [BRAND]?",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 73,
        "text": "1 Very dissatisfied",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 74,
        "text": "2 Dissatisfied",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 75,
        "text": "3 Neither satisfied nor dissatisfied",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 76,
        "text": "4 Satisfied",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 77,
        "text": "5 Very satisfied",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 78,
        "text": "B6. [NUM] How likely are you to recommend [BRAND] to a friend or colleague? 0 means not at all likely and 10 means extremely likely.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 79,
        "text": "RANGE 0-10.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 80,
        "text": "ASK IF B6 <= 6",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 81,
        "text": "B7. [OE] Why did you give [BRAND] a score of [B6]?",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 82,
        "text": "MINIMUM 3 CHARACTERS.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 83,
        "text": "END OF BRAND LOOP.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 84,
        "text": "Part C - Advertising",
        "style": "Heading 1",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": 1
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 85,
        "text": "ASK ALL",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 86,
        "text": "A1. [MC] In the past 4 weeks, have you seen or heard any advertising for these streaming services?",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 87,
        "text": "SHOW BRAND LIST + 98 Don't know + 99 None of these.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 88,
        "text": "ASK IF A1 = 3 (SEEN CORVO ADVERTISING)",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 89,
        "text": "A2. [INFO] On the next screen you will see an image from a recent advertisement.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 90,
        "text": "SHOW IMAGE AD_CORVO_W7.jpg FOR AT LEAST 8 SECONDS BEFORE A3.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 91,
        "text": "A3. [SC] Do you remember seeing this advertisement before today?",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 92,
        "text": "1 Yes, definitely",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 93,
        "text": "2 I think so",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 94,
        "text": "3 No",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 95,
        "text": "ASK IF A3 = 1 OR B9 = 1",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 96,
        "text": "A4. [MC] Where do you remember seeing it? Select all that apply.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 97,
        "text": "1 TV",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 98,
        "text": "2 Online video",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 99,
        "text": "3 Social media",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 100,
        "text": "4 Poster or billboard",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 101,
        "text": "97 Somewhere else",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 102,
        "text": "98 Can't remember",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 103,
        "text": "RANDOMISE CODES 1-4.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 104,
        "text": "ASK ALL WHO SAW THE AD IMAGE",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 105,
        "text": "A5. [GRID] How well does each of these describe the advertisement?",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": true,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 106,
        "text": "ROWS (RANDOMISE): r1 It was entertaining / r2 It was easy to understand / r3 It made me want to watch Corvo / r4 It was different from other adverts.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 107,
        "text": "COLUMNS: 1 Not at all / 2 A little / 3 Quite well / 4 Very well.",
        "style": "Normal",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "order": 108,
        "text": "Part D - About you",
        "style": "Heading 1",
        "is_bold": false,
        "heading_level": 1
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
